(H/(P+'.md')).write_text('\n'.join(['# Operad skills audit — in progress','',f"**{r['full_source_read_count']}/{r['scope_count']} full bodies reviewed; {len(r['remaining_work'])} pending.** Exact source hashes/ranges and assessments are in JSON.",'',f"{len(r['claims'])} claims and {len(r['findings'])} findings;57 observed independent controls and one unavailable shell control.",'','Reusable components include exact finite fibre witnesses, the fixed triangle certificate, MUB claim boundaries, explicit unavailable states and task/producer custody.','','New material defects include a complete two-state counterexample to the displayed CPTP skew-information inequality (0→1/15), closedness mistaken for pairwise agreement, nonzero H1 mistaken for missing global sections, Wigner normalization, and evidence-label upgrades by a schema conformer. These findings distinguish mathematical implications from syntax, finite samples and historical labels.','','No retained skill/workflow, provider or native build executed; source bytes remain untouched.'])+'\n');print(json.dumps({'full':r['full_source_read_count'],'findings':len(r['findings'])}))
